reviewers.summary:
The entry is mostly sound. The one blocking problem is the sense 6 example "You won't catch me eating there again!", which is a different idiom from the sense. Minor issues:
- loose wording in a few definitions and collocations;
- phrases marked with bold type in two explanations;
- the inflection facts repeated in the adaptation and learner-error fields;
- two missing common uses: "catch your breath" and "catch sight of / catch a glimpse of".
